UPDATE `item_template` SET `description` = '@Do Not Give To Players@\n从暗月马戏团西拉斯的密封卡包中获得！\n\n使用此技能卡可将其解锁到你的技能卡收藏中。技能卡收藏在同一服务器的所有角色间共享，你可以在技能卡收藏菜单中启用技能卡。\n\n使用此物品需要等级在 1 到 9 之间。邪铸角色需达到 20 级才能使用。' WHERE `entry` = 1180489 AND `description` = '@Do Not Give To Players@\nObtained from sealed card packs at Silas Darkmoon!\n\nUsing this Skill Card will unlock it in your Skill Card Collection. Your Skill Card Collection is shared with all characters on the realm, and you can activate skill cards in the Skill Card Collection menu.\n\nYou must be between level 1 and 9 to use this item. Felforged must be level 20 to use this item.';
