UPDATE `item_template` SET `description` = '@Worldforged@小心，镜片碎了，别让玻璃进眼睛！\n\n免责声明：此物品的镜片组件已损坏。请极其谨慎地操作，以免玻璃碎片造成眼部伤害。制造商对使用此损坏设备所导致的任何损害或不良状态效果不承担责任。请自行承担使用风险。' WHERE `entry` = 1381584 AND `description` = '@Worldforged@Watch out, the lens is broken, don''t get glass in your eyes!\n\nDISCLAIMER: This item features a compromised lens assembly. Handle with extreme caution to avoid ocular injury from glass fragments. Manufacturer assumes no liability for damages or adverse status effects resulting from the use of this damaged equipment. Use at your own risk.';
